duces a radius equal to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the width of a tile. The default value is 50."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterRadius","type":"topic","role":"symbol"}}}